{
  "_about": "Batch 4: the first sequel in each freshman chain (seasons 2-4). Each one only appears if the player made a specific freshman choice, so the text can call back to it. Write each so it reads fine a year or more later. Every flag in _info.must_set_flags must be set by some choice. Freshman callbacks: HS_030 <- HS_005 'Ask him to train together' (you and {tyler} trained together as freshmen). HS_034 <- HS_003 'Step in and help him find it' (you stood up for a freshman whose gear upperclassmen hid). HS_126 <- HS_101 'Stay calm and sort it out' (you calmly settled a locker mix-up with an older student). HS_134 <- HS_107 'Commit to the full morning' (you volunteered a full morning setting up a youth sports field). HS_139 <- HS_103 'Tell them to knock it off' (you publicly told a group chat to stop mocking a teammate). HS_145 <- HS_106 'Help train the backup holder' OR HS_140 junior-year flag trusted_holder_under_pressure: don't assume which one happened; write it around {holder} and trust. HS_157 <- HS_104 'Take the family trip' or 'Work out a split weekend', OR HS_129 (The First Paycheck) helped_family_financially: don't name the specific moment; keep it about family support in general. Pronouns: {tyler} and {parent} are male; never he/she for {holder}, {best_friend}, {coach}, {teacher}, {love_interest}.",
